This checkpoint passes because the workflow demonstrates:

- **high consequence**;
- **time criticality**;
- **existing technology**;
- **observable exception paths**;
- **human investigation**;
- **escalation requirement**;
- **strong cross-hospital generalisability**.

The company-specific residual burden remains unknown.

---

- Bengaluru laboratory study;
- 75,156 tests;
- 2,199 critical values;
- SMS + telephone;
- read-back;
- critical-value workflow.

